msgid "Step 1: Prepare the Template VM"
msgstr "Étape 1 : Préparer la VM modèle"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:50
msgid "Install Windows (Server 2016, 2019, 2022, 2025 or Windows 10/11)"
msgstr "Installez Windows (Server 2016, 2019, 2022, 2025 ou Windows 10/11)"

#: ../../provisioning/windows_cloud_guest_customization.rst:51
msgid "Install all Windows Updates"
msgstr "Installez toutes les mises à jour Windows"

